@gateway = http://localhost:5000

### 1 RVA101 53000 km - Accepted, oil at 80 percent
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/maintenance/odometer-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plate": "RVA101",
  "odometerKm": 53000,
  "readAt": "2026-11-12T08:00:00-05:00",
  "deviceId": "GPS-0101"
}

